  "releaseNotes": "- Updated LogicMonitor.Api to 3.240.93, which models Advanced Metrics reports and adds five\n\t\t  fields to types the datamart maps back to: Collector's archType, cpAgent,\n\t\t  logCollectorGroupId and logCollectorGroupName, and ResourceGroup's tenantIdentifier. The\n\t\t  datamart does not store them, so the reverse maps Ignore() them. Earlier Datamart\n\t\t  versions fail AutoMapper validation, and so cannot construct a DatamartClient, against\n\t\t  LogicMonitor.Api 3.240.90 or later.\n\t\t- Tests: removed AutoMapperTruncateTests' own profile-list validation, a partial copy of\n\t\t  ValidateAutoMapperProfiles that had fallen eight profiles behind.",
